有就興致沖沖的去吃，然後…….就是一整個驚嚇🤯⋯⋯\n\n醬油完全死鹹跟大安店層層堆疊的香氣，根本不同一家店吧⋯⋯真的不要這麼鬧欸\n肉也沒有香氣，溏心蛋切的方向滿奇特的，也沒有什麼味道，多吃一樣就心裡爆罵髒話一次🤣\nㄧ整碗可能只有麵體本人比較正常水準發揮\n\n叉燒也沒有炙燒過，不同分店不同做法就是了？\n\n恩😐就是不會再光臨\n那個樓梯也很危險，又陡又沒扶手，我只能說店家心臟真的很大顆",null,[0,63]]]],[],[null,null,45744,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210WFJqbHhPRVoxU2tGb2RrdE1VMFl3YVdwM1EzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x6fbbb446e6960df6!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmtXRjlxOEZ1SkFodktMU0YwaWp3Q3c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210WFJqbHhPRVoxU2tGb2RrdE1VMFl3YVdwM1EzYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210WFJqbHhPRVoxU2tGb2RrdE1VMFl3YVdwM1EzYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT210WFJqbHhPRVoxU2tGb2RrdE1VMFl3YVdwM1EzYxILMGRUOWUwZHF2SVMaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tdFhSamx4T0VaMVNrRm9ka3RNVTBZd2FXcDNRM2MSCzBkVDllMGRxdklTIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR9g2W5ka0u28qCzBkVDllMGRxdklT\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjBtJ2Su9KWAxV7ja8BHeBGAxsQoykIsgEoEA"],null,[null,[[1,3]]]],"0ahUKEwj-k6OSu9KWAxWyeV4EHV0vPP8Q0pMFCEsoBQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjBtJ2Su9KWAxV7ja8BHeBGAxsQ0pMFCJQBKAU"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WYVEyTnJRa2szUjJJM1JVWk5PVEZvYWtFNVEzYxAB",["0x0:0x6fbbb446e6960df6",null,1772775193894821,1772775193894821,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100284723165514449354/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Cheng Sam","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUPebdDdKPtcEVcUCEKbEvIV5IFWsu5Hq5NOxlp-0UfSncV4TW5TQ\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100284723165514449354?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"100284723165514449354",null,5,24,null,[1,4,1],0,["在地嚮導 · 5 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjBtJ2Su9KWAxV7ja8BHeBGAxsQpr8GCLQBKAA"]]]],null,"5 個月前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[4],null,[["CIABIhA0D_uCx1wN6BCB23YBAhVE",["CIABIhA0D_uCx1wN6BCB23YBAhVE",10,12,null,null,null,["https